@LLINK
Syntax: llink <file>... [<opts>]
Usage : devsys linker: ROF objects and libraries into an OS-9 module
Opts  : -o=<path>   output module (a bare name goes to /dd/cmds)
        -l=<file>   library (.l: objects one after another)
        -n=<name>   module name      -e=<n>  edition
        -M=<size>   extra data memory (pages, or K with K)
        -m          linkage map      -s      symbol table
        --lwlink, --mw  force lwlink's or Microware's module layout
                    (normally chosen from the objects)
